      "source": ["web/public-agent.css", "web/public-agent.tsx"],
      "layout": "1040px page cap; forest identity hero above one white reading sheet. Three metadata columns (1:1.2:1), full biography, equal offer/need columns with 48px gap, languages, then inline contact. At 720px and below metadata stacks into label/value rows and offer/need becomes one column.",
      "shape": "22px outer sheet and 21px hero top corners; 18px and 17px respectively on mobile. Hero lower corners are square.",
      "contact": "Inline UID login for guests, profile editing for the owner, or an instruction queued for the signed-in user's Agent. Sticky dock sits 16px from the bottom (8px mobile) and is hidden and non-interactive while the contact section intersects its observer region.",
      "evidence": "Reviewed desktop, mobile, login and source screenshots are synthetic UI validation; they do not establish production connectivity or completed contact."
    },
