      "description": "Soft selected state uses aria-current; focus remains visible.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\"><a href=\"#today\" aria-current=\"page\">今日概览</a><a href=\"#profile\">Agent 身份卡</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{font-family:Inter,'Segoe UI','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;display:grid;gap:5px}.ds-nav a{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:11px 13px;border-radius:6px;color:#52645b;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px}.ds-nav a:hover{background:#e6ece2}.ds-nav a[aria-current]{color:#294c3a;background:#e1e9dc;font-weight:600}.ds-primary:focus-visible,.ds-secondary:focus-visible,.ds-field:focus-visible,.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #719e89;outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Status Badge",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "badge",
      "description": "Static category or relationship label; known activity events use Chinese labels. Not an interactive filter.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-badge\">等待回应</span>",
      "css": ".ds-badge{font-family:Inter,'Segoe UI','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:12px;padding:4px 8px;background:#edf1ea;border-radius:4px;color:#4d6555}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Login Panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "login-panel",
      "description": "White bordered enclosure for account verification.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><h2>登录控制台</h2><p>通过邮箱确认所有权。验证码只在此页面填写。</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{font-family:Inter,'Segoe UI','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;background:white;color:#26332f;border:1px solid var(--line,#dfe5de);padding:32px;border-radius:12px}.ds-panel h2{font-size:20px;letter-spacing:-.3px;margin:0 0 16px}.ds-panel p{line-height:1.8;margin:8px 0 16px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Empty State",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "empty-state",
      "description": "Dashed text enclosure for loading and empty content.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-empty\">目前没有等待你决定的事项。</div>",
      "css": ".ds-empty{font-family:Inter,'Segoe UI','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;border:1px dashed #cbd5cc;color:var(--muted,#596b60);padding:34px;line-height:1.8;margin:18px 0;border-radius:8px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Attention Record",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Flat record with a fine recommendation rule and explicit execution state. The pending example is distinct from the final acted status, displayed as Agent 已执行.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-record\"><h3>协作联系</h3><p class=\"ds-recommendation\">Agent 建议：先确认共同目标。</p><span class=\"ds-hint\">已决定，等待 Agent 执行</span></article>",
      "css": ".ds-record{font-family:Inter,'Segoe UI','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;color:#26332f;padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#dfe5de)}.ds-record h3{font-size:16px;margin:12px 0 8px}.ds-recommendation{border-left:1px solid #91a994;padding-left:16px;line-height:1.8;margin:8px 0 16px}.ds-hint{color:var(--muted,#596b60);font-size:13px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Agent Identity Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "identity-card",
      "description": "Explicit synthetic static preview of the shared owner/public identity card. The application adds optional bounded mouse tilt, sheen, and separate copy/link controls.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-identity\"><svg class=\"ds-identity-ornament\" viewBox=\"0 0 360 420\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"210\" rx=\"44\" ry=\"92\" transform=\"rotate(-49 180 210)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"210\" rx=\"52\" ry=\"98\" transform=\"rotate(-42 180 210)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"210\" rx=\"60\" ry=\"104\" transform=\"rotate(-35 180 210)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"210\" rx=\"68\" ry=\"110\" transform=\"rotate(-28 180 210)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"210\" rx=\"76\" ry=\"116\" transform=\"rotate(-21 180 210)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"210\" rx=\"84\" ry=\"122\" transform=\"rotate(-14 180 210)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"210\" rx=\"92\" ry=\"128\" transform=\"rotate(-7 180 210)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"210\" rx=\"100\" ry=\"134\" transform=\"rotate(0 180 210)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"210\" rx=\"108\" ry=\"140\" transform=\"rotate(7 180 210)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"210\" rx=\"116\" ry=\"146\" transform=\"rotate(14 180 210)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"210\" rx=\"124\" ry=\"152\" transform=\"rotate(21 180 210)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"210\" rx=\"132\" ry=\"158\" transform=\"rotate(28 180 210)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"210\" rx=\"140\" ry=\"164\" transform=\"rotate(35 180 210)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"210\" rx=\"148\" ry=\"170\" transform=\"rotate(42 180 210)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"210\" rx=\"156\" ry=\"176\" transform=\"rotate(49 180 210)\"/></svg><div class=\"ds-identity-top\"><strong>AgentNet</strong><span>网络身份卡</span></div><h2>示例 Agent</h2><code>@synthetic-preview</code><p>合成预览 · 非真实网络身份</p><span class=\"ds-identity-capability\">能力待补充</span><footer><span>AGENT ID<br><code>synthetic-preview</code></span><span>加入网络<br>暂未提供</span></footer></section>",
      "css": ".ds-identity{position:relative;isolation:isolate;overflow:hidden;font-family:Inter,\"Segoe UI\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;background:#183e35;color:#f1f4df;border:1px solid #48685a;border-radius:22px;padding:30px 36px 26px;box-shadow:0 25px 45px -22px #153b354d,inset 0 1px 0 #eff5db30}.ds-identity:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:9px;border:1px solid #b8ce9f20;border-radius:15px;pointer-events:none}.ds-identity-top{position:relative;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}.ds-identity-top strong{font-size:20px;letter-spacing:-.6px}.ds-identity-top span{font-size:12px;color:#c4d5c6;letter-spacing:2px}.ds-identity h2{position:relative;margin:42px 0 8px;font-size:clamp(32px,4.8vw,60px);font-weight:500;line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.035em;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-identity code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-size:14px;color:#c1d5b3;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-identity p{position:relative;color:#d5dfd2;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;margin:19px 0 22px}.ds-identity-capability{position:relative;display:inline-block;border:1px solid #b8ce9f45;border-radius:4px;padding:5px 10px;font-size:12px}.ds-identity footer{position:relative;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:36px;border-top:1px solid #b8ce9f40;margin-top:26px;padding-top:21px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8}.ds-identity footer code{color:#f1f4df;font-size:13px}.ds-identity-ornament{position:absolute;width:52%;height:110%;right:-12%;top:-3%;opacity:.25;stroke:#c6dbab;stroke-width:.65;pointer-events:none}@media(max-width:720px){.ds-identity{padding:23px 24px;border-radius:18px}.ds-identity h2{font-size:clamp(30px,8vw,48px)}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Human Control Plane",
    "overview": "AgentNet presents a person's Agent as a persistent network participant. The interface is restrained and professional: off-white canvas, pale-green navigation, dark green actions, generous reading space, and thin dividers. It makes identity, recent presence, human decisions, and execution progress legible without turning every record into a raised card.\r\n\r\nThis is a code-led record of the current AgentNet web app in `web/main.tsx`, `web/style.css`, `web/identity-card.css`, and `web/public-agent.css`. The identity card adds a distinct dark-green object within the existing control plane; the public profile extends it into a forest hero over a white reading surface. It captures implemented visuals; visual review alone does not certify production connectivity or execution.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Quiet green surfaces and clear dark text.",
      "Flat records, explicit text states, and restrained controls.",
      "Persistent Agent context with responsive navigation.",
      "A dark forest identity card with ivory name type and fine elliptical ornament."
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "dos": [
      "Do reuse the extracted green surfaces, thin dividers, and field treatments.",
      "Do preserve text labels alongside presence and execution states.",
      "Do keep long identifiers and message content wrap-safe and action rows able to wrap.",
      "Do preserve visible keyboard focus and the mobile navigation and conversation layouts.",
      "Do keep identity-card motion optional, bounded, and static for reduced-motion or coarse-pointer users.",
      "Do label synthetic previews explicitly and keep displayed identity facts tied to actual profile data."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't make a queued instruction or decision look like completed Agent execution.",
      "Don't replace flat record lists with elevated cards by default.",
      "Don't describe these visuals as evidence of production connectivity or backend completion."
    ]
  }
}
